---
// M9 编辑器页：由 editorDev integration 仅在 dev 时 injectRoute（/dev/editor）。
// 本文件在 pages 目录外——build 不产出路由，兑现「生产 build 零新增页面/端点」。
// 样式为 dev 工具专属（is:global + ed- 前缀隔离），不入站点外观令牌体系。
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>notes 编辑器（dev-only）</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="editor-app" data-layout="side" data-sidebar="open">
  <aside id="ed-sidebar">
    <button type="button" id="ed-side-toggle" title="收起文档栏（Ctrl+B）">«</button>
    <div id="ed-side-body">
      <div class="ed-side-head">
        <strong>notes 文档</strong>
        <button type="button" id="ed-new" title="新建空白文档">新建</button>
      </div>
      <ul id="ed-docs"></ul>
      <div class="ed-import">
        <button type="button" id="ed-import-file">导入 .md</button>
        <button type="button" id="ed-import-dir" title="选 .md 及其图片所在的文件夹，图片自动搬进 public/img/">导入文件夹</button>
        <input type="file" id="ed-file" accept=".md,.markdown,text/markdown" hidden />
        <input type="file" id="ed-dir" webkitdirectory multiple hidden />
        <textarea id="ed-paste" placeholder="或粘贴 markdown 全文后点下方按钮…"></textarea>
        <button type="button" id="ed-import-paste">粘贴导入</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </aside>
  <div id="ed-content">
    <main id="ed-main">
    <div id="ed-bar">
      <label class="ed-slug-label">slug <input id="ed-slug" type="text" spellcheck="false" /></label>
      <span id="ed-status"></span>
      <button type="button" id="ed-layout" title="切换编辑/预览相对布局">布局：并排</button>
      <button type="button" id="ed-sync" title="编辑/预览滚动联动（锚点插值，边注按正文锚点跟随）">联动：开</button>
      <button type="button" id="ed-save">保存 Ctrl+S</button>
    </div>
    <div id="ed-hint"></div>
    <form id="ed-fm"></form>
    <div id="ed-blocks"></div>
    <div id="ed-toolbar">
      <button type="button" data-add="p">+ 段落</button>
      <button type="button" data-add="h2">+ 标题</button>
      <button type="button" data-add="essay">+ 随笔</button>
      <button type="button" data-add="note">+ 边注</button>
      <button type="button" data-add="code">+ 代码</button>
      <button type="button" data-add="image">+ 图片</button>
      <span class="ed-cheatsheet">Alt+1..5 切块格式（同键回段落，互斥）· 段内划选 + Alt+N 建边注 <button type="button" id="ed-help">更多…</button></span>
    </div>
    </main>
    <section id="ed-preview"><div id="ed-preview-mount"></div></section>
  </div>
  </div>
  <dialog id="ed-help-dialog">
    <div class="ed-help-body">
      <h2>操作提示</h2>
      <h3>块与控件</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>块模型互斥：每块单一类型。Alt+1..5 直切格式（1 段落 / 2 标题 H2 / 3 标题 H3 / 4 随笔 / 5 代码），同键再按回段落；边注、图片用工具栏 + 按钮。</li>
        <li>新增块落点：插到「最近获得焦点的块」之后；没点过任何块（或刚删过块）则追加到文末——先点目标块内任意输入框，再点 + 按钮即可指定插入位置；↑ ↓ 调序、删 删除。</li>
        <li>Ctrl+S 保存：PUT 前服务端跑与构建同源的校验重放（引用串失配、相对图片引用等），失配回显问题不落盘。</li>
        <li>其它：布局按钮循环三态（并排 / 上下 / 预览上）；Ctrl+B 侧栏收展；「联动」= 编辑↔预览滚动同步（锚点插值）；边注块左侧竖线 = 树形导轨——连接锚段落与本组边注，标红边框 = 锚定失配。</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>两种边注形态</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>行内锚</strong> <code>:note-m[词句]&#123;#id&#125;</code>（边注块引用串留空）：按 id 直配、永不失配。适合要点亮具体词句（点击召唤）、同一句多个相邻锚点、不想担失配风险。代价：正文混入自定义语法，锚区不可重叠。</li>
        <li><strong>引用式</strong>（边注块「引用串」填正文原句）：构建时在正文段落里检索定位。适合保持正文纯 markdown、事后补注、多条边注锚定重叠区域。代价：改正文要同步引用串，失配/歧义构建即红（编辑器中标红边框）。</li>
        <li>快捷建注：段落里划选一段文字 → Alt+N——自动生成引用串并即时校验唯一命中（多命中提示扩大选区），边注块插在该段之后，补上边注正文即可。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="ed-help-foot"><button type="button" id="ed-help-close">关闭（Esc）</button></div>
  </dialog>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  /* dev 工具样式：不入 theme.css 令牌体系（M1.5 约束管站点外观，此页不发布） */
  html, body { margin: 0; height: 100%; }
  #editor-app { display: flex; height: 100vh; font: 14px/1.6 system-ui, sans-serif; }
  /* 编辑/预览相对布局三态（M9.1）：side 并排 / stack 上下（编辑上）/ stack-rev 上下（预览上） */
  #ed-content { flex: 1; display: flex; min-width: 0; min-height: 0; }
  #editor-app[data-layout='stack'] #ed-content,
  #editor-app[data-layout='stack-rev'] #ed-content { flex-direction: column; }
  #editor-app[data-layout='stack-rev'] #ed-preview { order: -1; }
  /* 侧栏收展（M9.2）：收起 = 32px 窄轨仅留切换钮。#ed-side-body 钉死内容宽（min-width），
     宽度动画期间内容被 overflow-x 裁切滑出而非折行重排；侧栏宽变化经 flex 推挤预览面板，
     容器查询/ResizeObserver 自动跟形态（M9.1 已铺好，零额外代码） */
  #ed-sidebar { width: 220px; flex: none; border-right: 1px solid #ccc; overflow-x: hidden; overflow-y: auto; padding: 8px; transition: width .2s ease; }
  #editor-app[data-sidebar='collapsed'] #ed-sidebar { width: 32px; }
  #ed-side-toggle { display: block; margin-left: auto; width: 22px; height: 22px; padding: 0; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; background: #fafafa; color: #666; line-height: 1; cursor: pointer; }
  #ed-side-toggle:hover { background: #eee; }
  #ed-side-body { min-width: 220px; }
  #editor-app[data-sidebar='collapsed'] #ed-side-body { visibility: hidden; }
  .ed-side-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 4px; }
  #ed-docs { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  #ed-docs li { padding: 6px 8px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; }
  #ed-docs li:hover { background: #eee; }
  #ed-docs li.is-active { background: #dbeafe; }
  #ed-docs .ed-doc-slug { display: block; color: #888; font-size: 12px; }
  .ed-import { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; }
  .ed-import button { font: inherit; padding: 4px 6px; }
  .ed-import textarea { min-height: 72px; resize: vertical; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; padding: 4px 6px; font: 12px/1.5 ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace; }
  #ed-main { flex: 1.4; min-width: 360px; min-height: 240px; overflow-y: auto; padding: 12px 16px; border-right: 1px solid #ccc; }
  #editor-app[data-layout='stack'] #ed-main,
  #editor-app[data-layout='stack-rev'] #ed-main { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; }
  #ed-bar { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  #ed-bar .ed-slug-label { color: #666; }
  #ed-slug { width: 160px; }
  #ed-status { color: #b45309; flex: 1; }
  #ed-hint { white-space: pre-wrap; color: #b91c1c; font-size: 12px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  #ed-hint:empty { display: none; }
  #ed-fm { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 6px 12px; margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .ed-fm-field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; font-size: 12px; color: #666; }
  .ed-fm-field input { border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; padding: 3px 6px; font: inherit; }
  /* 尾部滚动余量挂 #ed-blocks 而非滚动容器 #ed-main：sticky 工具栏的活动范围是父级 content box，
     余量垫在 #ed-main 底部会把钉底上限抬到可见底上方 40vh，工具栏悬停编辑区正中贴不到底 */
  #ed-blocks { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding-bottom: 40vh; }
  .eb { border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px; padding: 6px 8px; background: #fafafa; }
  .eb-head { display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 12px; color: #666; }
  .eb-head .eb-type { font-weight: 600; color: #1d4ed8; }
  .eb-head .eb-id { color: #059669; }
  .eb-head .eb-spacer { flex: 1; }
  .eb textarea, .eb input { width: 100%; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; padding: 4px 6px; font: inherit; box-sizing: border-box; background: #fff; }
  .eb textarea { resize: none; overflow: hidden; display: block; }
  .eb textarea.eb-code { font-family: ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace; }
  .eb .eb-note-meta input { color: #555; }
  .eb button { font-size: 12px; padding: 2px 8px; }
  /* 树形导轨（M9.6）：边注块固定缩进，连接线用 border 几何绘制（与字体无关——
     Unicode 制表符在比例字体下错位，且字形只占一行文本高、跨不了整块高度）。
     through = 竖干贯穿本块并上跨 10px gap 接上一块；end = 组内末条，竖干止于肘线；
     none（挪离锚段/锚到别处）= 仅缩进不画线；失配另挂 data-miss 标红 */
  .eb[data-type='note'] { position: relative; margin-left: 20px; }
  .eb[data-rail='through']::before,
  .eb[data-rail='end']::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: -14px;
    top: -10px;
    bottom: 0;
    border-left: 1px solid #9ca3af;
  }
  .eb[data-rail='end']::before { bottom: auto; height: 27px; } /* 17px 肘线 + 10px 上跨 gap，干梢恰好接到肘线 */
  .eb[data-rail='through']::after,
  .eb[data-rail='end']::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: -14px;
    top: 17px;
    width: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid #9ca3af;
  }
  .eb[data-miss='1'] { border-color: #fca5a5; }
  .eb[data-miss='1'] .eb-id { color: #b91c1c; }
  /* 单行 flex 挤压会把按钮/速查都压到内容宽以下而折行：wrap + 速查占满整行（basis:100%）= 按钮独享首行 */
  #ed-toolbar { position: sticky; bottom: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; align-items: center; padding: 8px 0; background: linear-gradient(transparent, #fff 40%); }
  #ed-toolbar button { white-space: nowrap; }
  .ed-cheatsheet { flex-basis: 100%; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 12px; color: #888; margin-left: 8px; }
  #ed-help { font-size: 12px; padding: 0; margin-left: 4px; border: none; background: none; color: #1d4ed8; text-decoration: underline; cursor: pointer; }
  /* 帮助浮层（M9.6）：原生 dialog（Esc 自动关），点遮罩/关闭钮亦关；
     flex 列布局 + 关闭钮固定页脚——内容超高时只滚正文区，按钮不被滚出视口 */
  #ed-help-dialog { border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 8px; padding: 0; width: min(36rem, calc(100% - 2rem)); display: flex; flex-direction: column; max-height: 80vh; }
  #ed-help-dialog::backdrop { background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .35); }
  .ed-help-body { padding: 14px 18px 16px; overflow: auto; min-height: 0; flex: 1; }
  .ed-help-body h2 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 16px; }
  .ed-help-body h3 { margin: 12px 0 4px; font-size: 13px; color: #1d4ed8; }
  .ed-help-body ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2em; }
  .ed-help-body li { margin: 4px 0; }
  .ed-help-body code { background: #eee; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0 4px; font-family: ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; }
  .ed-help-foot { padding: 10px 18px 14px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; }
  #ed-preview { flex: 1.2; min-width: 320px; min-height: 240px; overflow: auto; padding: 16px; }
  /* 预览面板 = 响应式判据的度量对象（M9.1）：容器查询驱动窄屏形态，正文列钳在面板宽内。
     生产行为不受影响——全站无其它 container-type 祖先，@container 仅在此命中 */
  #ed-preview-mount { container-type: inline-size; --main-width: min(42rem, 100%); }
  #ed-preview-mount:empty::before { content: '实时预览（150ms 防抖，渲染与构建同源）'; color: #aaa; }

  /* 容器版窄屏形态（复刻 global.css 的 M4 @media 块，断点同 1100）：
     面板 ≤1100px → 折叠条 + 模态；面板 >1100px → 全局默认桌面三栏（无需重述）。
     视口 @media 与容器 @container 不可能冲突：面板宽 ≤ 视口宽，两者同窄时规则一致，
     视口宽面板窄时只有容器规则生效 */
  @container (max-width: 1100px) {
    .note-layout {
      max-width: var(--main-width);
    }
    .margin-note {
      float: none;
      width: auto;
      margin: 0.9rem 0;
      border: none;
      padding: 0.55rem 0.9rem;
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 5%, transparent);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }
    .margin-note > :not(.note-preview) {
      display: none;
    }
    .note-preview {
      display: -webkit-box;
      -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
      -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
      overflow: hidden;
      min-height: 2.75em;
      font-size: var(--font-size-note);
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
    }
    .note-copy {
      display: none;
    }
    .margin-note.is-modal {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      margin: auto;
      width: min(34rem, calc(100% - 2rem));
      height: fit-content;
      max-height: 72vh;
      overflow: auto;
      z-index: 60;
      background: var(--paper);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-modal);
      padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
      cursor: default;
    }
    .margin-note.is-modal > :not(.note-preview) {
      display: revert;
    }
    .margin-note.is-modal .note-preview {
      display: none;
    }
    .margin-note.is-modal .note-copy {
      display: block;
      visibility: visible;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  import { initEditor } from '../scripts/editor-engine.js';
  initEditor();
</script>
